# Lab Client build artefacts.
#
# clients/lab-client/dist holds the frozen lab_client.exe, which is a 15 MB binary
# regenerated by build.ps1. The legacy repo made the opposite call and committed a
# 30 MB Python installer, which is why it was in the repository at all; a build output
# does not belong in version control when the command that produces it is committed
# beside it.
#
# /clients/lab-client/dist also includes the only built copy, so note it is safe to
# delete at any time and rebuild with: clients\lab-client\build.ps1
/clients/lab-client/.venv
/clients/lab-client/build
/clients/lab-client/dist
/clients/lab-client/__pycache__
/clients/lab-client/*.pyc
